<ansi fg="black-bold">.:</ansi> <ansi fg="magenta">Help for </ansi><ansi fg="yellow">Bioluminescence</ansi> mutation

Light blooms beneath your skin in shifting patterns of pale blue and
green. You are a beacon in the dark — beautiful, conspicuous, and
impossible to ignore.

<ansi fg="yellow">Requires:</ansi>  Skin
<ansi fg="yellow">Type:</ansi>     Passive
<ansi fg="yellow">Rarity:</ansi>   Uncommon

<ansi fg="yellow">Benefits:</ansi>
  Your body emits natural light, illuminating the area around you

<ansi fg="yellow">Drawbacks:</ansi>
  Moderately reduced charisma — the eerie glow unsettles most people

<ansi fg="yellow">Conflicts:</ansi> Camo Skin

<ansi fg="magenta-bold">See also:</ansi> <ansi fg="command">help mutations</ansi>
